From 6f853adc61d5d175ee83c69f6c07ab2da112cabc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:30:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dl-consolidation landing edit LE-repoint-nmsim: re-point the
 nm-sim files to the consolidated names

#297 (nm-sim) landed before the consolidation and uses names the consolidation moved.
Re-pointed in the nm-sim modules (proofs to explicit published names; docstrings only where
they spelled a stale qualified name; the two statements that mention castImpl keep their
text byte for byte, the unqualified name resolving to Games.castImpl through the open Games):
- GGMRed.ofFn_padFin_of_length -> ofFn_padFin_of_length;
- AdaptiveCPA.{castImpl, castImpl_eq, expect_simulate_castImpl_toCompOn, padFin_ofFn_zeroBits,
  simulate_eq_of_abs} -> Games.*; AdaptiveCPA.ofFn_cast -> root ofFn_cast;
  AdaptiveCPA.ofFn_splitHalf_fst/_snd -> FixedLengthScheme.*;
- ChallengeSim.{expect_sample_equiv, expect_sample_comm, expect_sub} -> ProbComp.* (Games.ProbComp);
- the selective `open AdaptiveCPA (...)` lines of Simulation, SimIND, IndSim and Simulator
  removed (every name they opened moved).
DL-37: nm-sim's private padFin_replicate_false (Simulation/Challenge.lean) deleted; its use
reads Games.padFin_replicate_false. Lines over 100 characters re-wrapped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTiuDcjSqhyfbqnsVxA
